OL,4,CUS Army to detonate tonnes of unstable 
OL,5,Cexplosives in Iowa despite court order 
OL,6,GThe US Army plans to move ahead with   
OL,7,Gdetonating five tonnes of degraded     
OL,8,Gexplosives in Iowa despite a ruling to 
OL,9,Ghalt it indefinitely, a new court      
OL,10,Gfiling shows.                          
OL,12,F"To protect its personnel and the      
OL,13,Fsurrounding communities, the Army      
OL,14,Fneeds to take swift action," the       
OL,15,Fjustice department notified the court  
OL,16,Fon Saturday. "Protection of human      
OL,17,Fhealth and the environment demand      
OL,18,Faction now, not delay."                
